<title>USA: Molecular, SmithKline in deal.</title>
<headline>Molecular, SmithKline in deal.</headline>
<dateline>SUNNYVALE, Calif. 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Molecular Dynamics Inc said it entered an agreement with SmithKline Beecham Plc to develop instrumentation that is expected to significantly speed new drug and diagnostic discovery and development.</p>
<p>Under the agreement, SmithKline will provide it capital in exchange for early access to Molecular Dynamics' latest technology, Molecular Dynamics will further develop its proprietary laser fluorescence confocal scanning technology for the analysis of DNA. It said the new system enables scientists to perform gene expression analyses with greater flexibility.</p>
</text>
